<title>UK: London tea sale average price.</title>
<headline>London tea sale average price.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The weighted average for the 5,300 packages of landed tea sold at this weeks London sale was 114.67 pence a kilo against 113.87 last week and 111.60 a year ago.</p>
<p>The average for the 280,124 pkgs sold so far this year is 113.16 pence against 102.91 pence for the 400,258 pkgs sold by this stage last year.</p>
</text>
